<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>学習記録 — Study Record</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheet.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="メインナビゲーション">
        <a class="brand" href="#timer"
          ><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">s.</span
          ><span>学習記録<small>STUDY RECORD</small></span></a
        >
        <p class="nav-caption">YOUR WORKSPACE</p>
        <nav class="navigation">
          <a href="#timer" data-page="timer"
            ><span aria-hidden="true">◷</span>計測する</a
          >
          <a href="#review" data-page="review"
            ><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span>振り返る</a
          >
          <a href="#subjects" data-page="subjects"
            ><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span>分野を管理</a
          >
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-bottom">
          <p>小さな積み重ねを、<br />確かな自信に。</p>
          <span class="demo-tag">UI DEMO</span
          ><small>サンプルデータでお試し中</small>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <div class="workspace">
        <header class="topbar">
          <span id="today-label"></span>
          <div class="account">
            <span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">S</span
            ><span>study_user</span
            ><a href="/login.html">ログイン画面を見る ↗</a>
          </div>
        </header>
        <main id="main-content">
          <div class="demo-banner">
            <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>画面デモ
            <span class="banner-detail"
              >データはブラウザー内のメモリで操作します。再読み込みで初期状態に戻ります。</span
            >
          </div>
          <div id="running-banner" class="running-banner" hidden>
            <span>計測中 <strong id="running-time">00:00:00</strong></span
            ><a href="#timer">計測画面へ戻る →</a>
          </div>
          <section id="page-timer" class="page" aria-labelledby="timer-heading">
            <div class="page-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">MAKE TIME FOR YOURSELF</p>
                <h1 id="timer-heading">今日の学びを、ここから。</h1>
                <p class="description">
                  まずは目の前の学びに集中。分野やメモは、終わってから。
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="page-index" aria-hidden="true">01 / FOCUS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="focus-layout">
              <section class="timer-card" aria-label="ストップウォッチ">
                <div class="card-top">
                  <span class="eyebrow">FOCUS SESSION</span
                  ><span id="timer-status" class="pill">開始前</span>
                </div>
                <div class="clock-face">
                  <div class="clock-center">
                    <span class="clock-caption">あなたの学びの時間</span
                    ><output id="timer" class="clock-digits">00:00:00</output
                    ><span class="clock-subtitle">ONE STEP AT A TIME</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <button
                  id="timer-action"
                  class="button button-primary timer-action"
                  type="button"
                >
                  ▶ 計測を開始
                </button>
                <p class="timer-hint" id="timer-hint">
                  終わったら、学んだことを記録しましょう。
                </p>
                <div class="manual-entry">
                  <span>計測を忘れてしまっても大丈夫。</span
                  ><button class="text-button" id="manual-add" type="button">
                    計測せずに記録する ↗
                  </button>
                </div>
              </section>
              <aside class="focus-side">
                <div class="today-card">
                  <div class="card-top">
                    <span class="eyebrow">TODAY'S PROGRESS</span
                    ><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                  </div>
                  <h2>今日の積み重ね</h2>
                  <div id="today-total" class="today-total"></div>
                  <div class="thin-rule"></div>
                  <p id="today-count" class="muted"></p>
                  <a href="#review" class="text-link">学習記録を振り返る →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="note-card">
                  <span class="note-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
                  <h2>記録は、あとでまとめて。</h2>
                  <p>
                    途中で学ぶ分野が変わっても、<br />計測はそのままで。<br />終了後に時間を分けて記録できます。
                  </p>
                  <span class="note-footer">LESS FRICTION, MORE FOCUS.</span>
                </div>
              </aside>
            </div>
            <section class="recent-section" aria-labelledby="recent-heading">
              <div class="section-heading">
                <h2 id="recent-heading">最近の学習記録</h2>
                <a href="#review" class="text-link">カレンダーへ →</a>
              </div>
              <div id="recent-records" class="recent-list"></div>
            </section>
          </section>
          <section
            id="page-review"
            class="page"
            aria-labelledby="review-heading"
            hidden
          >
            <div class="page-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">LOOK BACK, MOVE FORWARD</p>
                <h1 id="review-heading">積み重ねが、見えてくる。</h1>
                <p class="description">
                  学んだ時間も、学んだことも。あなたの歩みを振り返りましょう。
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="page-index" aria-hidden="true">02 / REFLECT</span>
            </div>
            <div class="review-overview">
              <section class="total-card">
                <span class="eyebrow">TOTAL STUDY TIME</span>
                <h2>トータル学習時間</h2>
                <div id="all-total" class="large-total"></div>
                <span class="muted">保存したすべての学習記録から集計</span>
              </section>
              <section class="subject-summary">
                <div class="section-heading">
                  <h2>分野別の学習時間</h2>
                  <span class="muted">累計</span>
                </div>
                <div id="subject-totals"></div>
              </section>
            </div>
            <section class="calendar-card" aria-labelledby="calendar-heading">
              <div class="section-heading">
                <div>
                  <p class="eyebrow">LEARNING CALENDAR</p>
                  <h2 id="calendar-heading">学習カレンダー</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="calendar-controls">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    id="previous-month"
                    class="icon-button"
                    aria-label="前月"
                  >
                    ←
                  </button>
                  <h3 id="calendar-month"></h3>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    id="next-month"
                    class="icon-button"
                    aria-label="翌月"
                  >
                    →</button
                  ><button
                    type="button"
                    id="this-month"
                    class="button button-small"
                  >
                    今月
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="muted calendar-help">
                日付を選ぶと、記録の確認・追加・編集ができます。
              </p>
              <div class="weekdays" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>日</span><span>月</span><span>火</span><span>水</span
                ><span>木</span><span>金</span><span>土</span>
              </div>
              <div id="calendar-grid" class="calendar-grid"></div>
            </section>
          </section>
          <section
            id="page-subjects"
            class="page"
            aria-labelledby="subjects-heading"
            hidden
          >
            <div class="page-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">ORGANIZE YOUR LEARNING</p>
                <h1 id="subjects-heading">学びの分野を整える。</h1>
                <p class="description">
                  あなたが学びたいことを、自由に追加しましょう。
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="page-index" aria-hidden="true">03 / ORGANIZE</span>
            </div>
            <section class="panel subject-create">
              <h2>新しい分野を追加</h2>
              <form id="subject-form" novalidate>
                <label for="subject-name"
                  >分野名 <span class="required">必須</span></label
                >
                <div class="inline-form">
                  <input
                    id="subject-name"
                    name="name"
                    type="text"
                    maxlength="100"
                    placeholder="例：JavaScript、英語、デザイン"
                    aria-describedby="subject-error"
                  /><button type="submit" class="button button-primary">
                    ＋ 分野を追加
                  </button>
                </div>
                <p id="subject-error" class="field-error" role="alert"></p>
              </form>
            </section>
            <section class="panel">
              <div class="section-heading">
                <h2>登録済みの分野</h2>
                <span id="subject-count" class="muted"></span>
              </div>
              <p class="muted">
                名前の変更は過去の記録にも反映されます。記録で使われている分野は削除できません。
              </p>
              <div id="subject-list" class="subject-list"></div>
              <p id="subject-list-error" class="field-error" role="alert"></p>
            </section>
          </section>
          <footer class="page-footer">
            <span>STUDY RECORD</span><span>今日の一歩を、明日の自信に。</span>
          </footer>
        </main>
      </div>
    </div>
    <dialog
      id="study-modal"
      class="record-dialog"
      aria-labelledby="record-title"
    >
      <form id="record-form" novalidate>
        <div class="dialog-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">SAVE YOUR PROGRESS</p>
            <h2 id="record-title">学習記録を入力</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="dialog-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dialog-body">
          <div class="record-meta">
            <div>
              <label for="study-date"
                >学習日 <span class="required">必須</span></label
              ><input
                type="date"
                id="study-date"
                name="studyDate"
                aria-describedby="date-error"
              />
              <p id="date-error" class="field-error"></p>
            </div>
            <div id="measured-box" class="measured-box">
              <span class="muted">今回の計測時間</span
              ><strong id="measured-time"></strong>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h3>学習の内訳</h3>
            <span class="muted">メモは任意です</span>
          </div>
          <div id="record-rows" class="record-rows"></div>
          <button type="button" class="button button-dashed" id="add-row">
            ＋ 入力行を追加
          </button>
          <p id="record-error" class="field-error" role="alert"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="dialog-footer">
          <div class="record-total">
            <span>合計学習時間</span
            ><output id="record-total">0時間00分</output>
          </div>
          <p id="time-warning" class="notice" hidden></p>
          <div class="dialog-actions">
            <button
              type="button"
              class="button button-quiet"
              id="discard-record"
            >
              破棄する</button
            ><button
              type="submit"
              class="button button-primary"
              id="save-record"
            >
              記録する →
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </dialog>
    <dialog id="daily-modal" class="daily-dialog" aria-labelledby="daily-title">
      <div class="dialog-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">DAILY RECORDS</p>
          <h2 id="daily-title"></h2>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="close-daily"
          class="icon-button"
          aria-label="日別の記録を閉じる"
        >
          ×
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="dialog-body">
        <div class="daily-total">
          <span>この日の学習時間</span><strong id="daily-total"></strong>
        </div>
        <div id="daily-records"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dialog-footer dialog-actions">
        <button type="button" class="button" id="daily-close-bottom">
          閉じる</button
        ><button type="button" id="daily-add" class="button button-primary">
          ＋ 記録を追加
        </button>
      </div>
    </dialog>
    <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <script type="module" src="/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
